activity Identify Risks
activity Develop Continuity Plan
activity Test Continuity Plan
activity Review Test Results
activity Implement Improvements
activity Communicate Plan
activity Conduct Training
activity Monitor Risks
activity Activate Continuity Plan
activity Evaluate Incident Response
bind Identify Risks: Risk Level
bind Develop Continuity Plan: Stakeholder Engagement
bind Test Continuity Plan: Test Outcome
bind Review Test Results: Plan Effectiveness, Improvement Status
bind Communicate Plan: Communication Method
bind Monitor Risks: Monitoring Frequency
bind Activate Continuity Plan: Incident Severity
bind Evaluate Incident Response: Response Time
bind Conduct Training: Training Hours
Risk Level: integer between 1 and 10
Test Outcome: Pass, Fail
Plan Effectiveness: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Improvement Status: Pending, Completed
Stakeholder Engagement: High, Low
Communication Method: Email, Meeting
Monitoring Frequency: integer between 1 and 365
Incident Severity: Low, Medium, High
Response Time: float between 0.0 and 1000.0
Training Hours: integer between 0 and 1000
Init[Identify Risks] | |
End[Evaluate Incident Response] | |
Response[Test Continuity Plan, Review Test Results] |A.Test Outcome is Pass | |
Chain Response[Review Test Results, Implement Improvements] |(A.Plan Effectiveness < 80.0) AND (A.Improvement Status is Pending) | |0,48,h
Response[Develop Continuity Plan, Communicate Plan] |A.Stakeholder Engagement is High | |5,13,m
Response[Communicate Plan, Conduct Training] |A.Communication Method is Meeting | |
Co-Existence[Monitor Risks, Identify Risks] |A.Monitoring Frequency <= 7 | |
Precedence[Identify Risks, Activate Continuity Plan] |A.Incident Severity in (Medium, High) | |
Not Chain Response[Activate Continuity Plan, Evaluate Incident Response] |A.Incident Severity is High | |10,15,s
Existence[Conduct Training] | |